WEBVTT

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.480
<b>Hey, cutie.  Tell me your mail address.</b>

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.560
<b>Let's get something to eat at WacDonald's.</b>

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:23.730
<b>Hey, come on, cutie~</b>

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.700
<b>Shut up!  I'm a guy!</b>

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.440
<b>Hi, everyone!  How're ya doing?</b>

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.830
<b>I'm doing great!</b>

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.000
<b>A demon?!</b>

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.000
<b>Pretty soon, a fantastic party is gonna start up.</b>

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.510
<b>So there are demons in this age as well?</b>

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.060
<b>I hope everyone has fun!</b>

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:01.640
<b>I'll take some time out of my journey to exterminate you!</b>

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.260
<b>Sit!</b>

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:04.740
<b>What was that?</b>

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:07.850
<b>Inuyasha!  What are you thinking?</b>

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:09.770
<b>Huh?</b>

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:14.520
<b>I don't know which one of the cursed springs you fell into,</b>

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:18.840
<b>but your transformation looks a little incomplete, huh?</b>

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:21.100
<b>Hey, your voice sounds a lot like mine.</b>

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.280
<b>What the hell do you think you're doing?!</b>

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:32.030
<b>In this form, you look <i>so much better</i>!</b>

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.700
<b>Yo, you're pretty awesome too!</b>

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.920
<b>Hey, what's your name?  What's your mail address?</b>

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.330
<b>What are your 3 sizes?</b>

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.200
<b>Are you Miroku-sama's teacher?</b>

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:47.080
<b>Hey you!  You've got some guts to be flirting with Kagome in front of me!</b>

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.490
<b>Everyone, let's be friends, okay?</b>

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.040
<b>Daaaarliiiiing!</b>

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.150
<b>Wha, wait, wait, Lum!  I'm sorry!</b>

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.340
<b>I won't forgive infidelity!</b>

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.380
<b>I'll protect Kagome!</b>

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.680
<b>Diamond Spear Blast!</b>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.730
<b>Trying to grope <i>me</i>?!</b>

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:15.180
<b>I won't forgive you for that!</b>

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.690
<b>Lion's Roar Shot!  Proud Fierce Tiger!</b>

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.870
<b>Daarliiing!</b>

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.150
<b>Wait up, damn it!</b>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.570
<b>Like you'll get away!</b>

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:35.840
<b>At any rate...</b>

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:39.110
<b>For the Weekly Shonen Sunday 50th Anniversary Celebration...</b>

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.690
<b>Everyone's gathered for a fantastic party!</b>

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.790
<b>Let's begin!</b>

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.030
<b>Good job!</b>

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.910
Tessaiga gains the power of defeated enemies.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:39.090
But Tenseiga doesn't have that ability.

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.440
Father's true intent...

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.670
...is that my Dark Path of the Dawn Moon's Wave becomes perfect.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:52.320
And once again Tenseiga and Tessaiga become one.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:57.000
It's time you already accept the will of your father.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:05.970
I, Sesshomaru, was left nothing by father.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.530
Was that your intention?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.670
Is that what your really think, Sesshomaru-sama?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:22.910
Did you mean to kill me with that one?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.590
Sesshomaru-sama... there is something I would like to give you.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.180
Byakuya of Illusions?

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.670
You have problems with the sword, right?

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:37.740
Don't get angry. I know everything.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:42.960
Your Tenseiga was formerly part of Inuyasha's Tessaiga, right?

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.360
Hmmm! With people like you...

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:49.240
... I have nothing to talk about.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.470
Mirror shard...

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.290
Hey you! How long are you going to sit here?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.870
Get out of here!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:10.420
Che ?! We are here because you, the little things are pot-bellied, are not capable of anything at all!

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:12.110
Who is this trio of pot-bellied..

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.180
Paw, are those something to tear off?

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.910
Leave me alone, jerk!

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.260
Inuyasha, you love to hurt everyone...

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.990
Ah... Miso Kagome-sama is just delicious!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.830
Thanks, Rin-chan.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:29.420
What did I say? Food from the world of Kagome-sama is all delicious.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.350
Sister should learn from her...

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.010
Did you say something to Kohaku?

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.500
No, nothing.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:41.380
Kohaku, Sango is really a fighting girl, who can only fight, but...

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.010
... she's still sweet.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.350
Hands off my ass!

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.840
Can I ever call him a brother?

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.090
Wow, so stretchy!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.740
Enough, Inuyasha!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.380
Sit down!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:06.060
Sesshomaru-sama... come back faster.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.060
Oh! Sesshomaru-sama!

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:11.880
Sesshomaru!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.210
Sesshomaru-sama!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:17.320
Sesshomaru-sama...

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:21.570
... is a fragment of the spirit of Cannes's mirror.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:29.870
With it, you can take power from Tessaiga.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:34.730
Just insert this shard into the Tenseiga blade.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.670
That will be enough.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:39.730
Hmmm! That is what Naraku wants.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:43.090
So that I, Sesshomaru, fight Inuyasha...

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:48.700
...and if we are lucky that we both weaken, will put our plan into action.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.090
However, it’s worth a try.

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.490
Get the sword, Inuyasha.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:57.640
Oh?

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:10.260
Inuyasha
Black Tessaiga
Translated by: Term

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.370
Sesshomaru, what do you want?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.050
He said the same, reach for the sword.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:17.390
Sesshomaru...

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.390
Going to fight Inuyasha?

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:22.050
How grateful I am to you, Sesshomaru-sama!

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:27.050
Inuyasha mocked your lovely Jaken, teach him a lesson!

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:32.530
Here is a stubborn one! Still want my sword?

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.940
It looks like you are serious.

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:41.630
Then I won't hold back!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.770
Wind Scar!

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.500
The Wind Scar didn't work!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.410
Tenseiga smells... Really...

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.000
Wind Scar!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.840
Sesshomaru, you bastard! You sold Naraku your soul!?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:14.820
How so?

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.500
Sesshomaru-sama...

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.160
From your sword bears the smell of Naraku.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.080
I'm sorry, this is how I smell.

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.240
Mugen but Byakuya!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.580
A gift from Cannes.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:33.640
I gave Sesshomaru-sama a fragment of the spirit of the Cannes mirror.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.550
Spirit of the Mirror...

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:40.510
When Inuyasha fought him, he took all his strength from him.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.240
The demon who was defeated with difficulty...?

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.240
Hoshi-sama, use the hole.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.710
Yes, if it works, then at least Tenseiga will be sucked.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:51.140
But Sesshomaru-sama...!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.830
Naraku wanted to kill Kohaku!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.300
But did you listen to him anyway?

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:02.310
Damn, how noisy here...

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:05.690
How about I send you somewhere you can safely fight?

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.800
Uh...? Moon?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.560
Oh! Gone!

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:22.870
Where have they gone?

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:24.640
In endless sleep.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:28.520
In eternal sleep, illusion.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.110
That's it.

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.110
To you! Hiraikotsu!

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:36.240
Ran away.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:43.710
Unbelievable...

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:47.060
To use Sesshomaru, Naraku's power...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:00.010
I see. There really is nothing stopping us.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.720
You disappointed me, Sesshomaru. Falling so much to get Tessaiga?

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.930
Adamant Barrage!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.450
You disappointed me too, Inuyasha.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.240
Is that all you can do?

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:28.220
In this case, you were not originally worthy of Tessaiga.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.950
Hmmm! Did the scabbards protect you with their barrier?

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:36.200
Sesshomaru, creature!

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.450
You actually tried to kill me!

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.960
Get it!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.610
If you are weak, I will kill you!

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:56.620
And then I'll throw Tessaiga and Tenseiga!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:05.490
Prove to me Inuyasha that not I, but you are the true receiver of Tessaiga.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.200
Prove it?

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:11.010
I mean, if I win, will you finally give up?

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.380
Well, try it.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:22.790
If it blows you away, Inuyasha, it means you could do no more.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.620
This is not the limit of my strength!

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:42.130
Well, you are a villain, Sesshomaru. No pity at all.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:45.180
You strongly hate Inuyasha.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:47.280
This is what we use.

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:53.220
Sesshomaru seems to be strongly tied to his father's sword.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.760
I see.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:59.100
Therefore, it was enough to add fuel to the fire.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.230
Even knowing that this is a trap...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.240
... Sesshomaru went into it, burned by the desire to kill Inuyasha.

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:08.770
How I wanted it.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.030
Yes. And it seems he has already succeeded in this.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.700
I wonder if Inuyasha is alright?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.080
Sesshomaru-sama...!

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.160
Those strange clouds thickened.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:32.020
Totosai-sama!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.510
It seems that everything has already begun.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.230
Do you know what's going on?

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:39.590
U... and... Want to see?

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.070
Please!

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.680
Hmm... Here.

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.550
Sesshomaru-sama!

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.900
Inuyasha... Where is Inuyasha?

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:18.960
Hmmm! In desperation, turned into a demon?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:26.800
Inuyasha!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.610
But, that face...

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:32.070
Yes... The demon's blood in it began to take over.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:36.500
Tessaiga responds to my increased strength.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:40.890
It resonates with Inuyasha's sword.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:46.690
The strength taken from Tessaiga flows into me.

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:48.400
Sesshomaru!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:56.760
Forces are back!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.580
Great!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:07.550
Hmmm! When did the swords clash part of the force go back?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:17.310
So much you want to go back to Inuyasha?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.300
Wind Scar!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:24.500
Hmm... Backlash Wave!

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.380
We'll handle it, Tessaiga!

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:35.110
Backlash Wave!

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.050
Amazing!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.050
He returned the Backlash Wave with a Backlash Wave!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:11.200
Next I will return the Adamant Barrage!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:15.850
Inuyasha... if you are a true receiver of Tessaiga, then...

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.310
Dark Path of the Dawn Moon's Wave!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.340
Try to repel this blow.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:39.340
So Sesshomaru, looking him straight in the forehead, used the Dark Path of the Dawn Moon's Wave.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:41.450
You can’t run away from it.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.010
Byakuya, show me this.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:48.690
Abomination.

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.660
Surely you can see something?

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.660
Yes, you can see perfectly.

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:56.920
It can be seen how Inuyasha disappears in Meidō.

00:16:03.390 --> 00:16:07.860
Dark Path of the Dawn Moon's Wave, I studied the attack.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:12.540
If fate is destined to be yours,...

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.420
... then try to pick it up.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.210
Damn it. Nothing comes out!

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.890
Need to think of something! Anything!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:25.190
What should I do, Tessaiga?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.220
Is that all, Inuyasha?

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:33.160
But you should have been the receiver of Tessaiga...

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.580
Father, that's all he can do.

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:40.460
Goodbye Disappear in the realm of the dead...

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.020
... together with Inuyasha.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:52.170
T... Tessaiga...!

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.650
W-What is this?

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:01.300
Dragon Tessaiga!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.830
Is this the Inuyasha demonic energy?

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:17.400
What does this mean? Does Dragon Tessaiga want to cut something with demonic energy?

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:19.440
But what?

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:24.980
There is nothing... Here, only my demonic energy.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:27.440
What to chop?

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:33.620
Will Inuyasha achieve Tessaiga's desire?

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.390
- What?
- Tessaiga's desire?

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:41.700
Until Inuyasha realizes that he wants Tessaiga, he will not be able to get out of there.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:45.420
He can! Inuyasha fought so long with the Tessaiga!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:47.960
He can not fail to understand the desires of Tessaiga!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:53.080
Hmm... Well, even if they understand, will he succeed?

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:54.220
Everything will be fine!

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.680
Yes! Inuyasha can definitely!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:58.590
I think so too.

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:02.730
That's just like Inuyasha, stupid as a stump.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.730
And the evil thing.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:11.860
Dragon Tessaiga serves to chop the enemy’s demonic energy source, the demonic whirlwind, right?

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.750
True, but Meidō is not a demon.

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:20.160
A demonic aura or a whirl means nothing, it will not be able to destroy Meidō.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:23.970
What do I need to chop, Tessaiga?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.830
My demonic whirlwind?

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.970
Is this who I have to chop? My demonic whirlwind?

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:35.950
In other words, you must cut short your own life.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.580
Inuyasha, are you capable of this?

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.580
This is not the end.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.000
It's too early to bury me!

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.850
This will not break me!

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:52.720
Inuyasha!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:55.250
Don't let me down, Tessaiga!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.910
I believe in you!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.270
Heh! Out of your mind, Inuyasha?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.380
Demonic energy is increasing!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:24.320
My demonic energy flows through me and Tessaiga!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:27.960
This is...

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:34.760
...proof of the sword's true owner?

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:37.040
What is going on?

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.710
However, faster than I thought.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:41.470
<i>What?</i>

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:46.630
Tessaiga and Tenseiga, two swords merge into one.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.530
Does Inuyasha's demonic energy absorb Meidō?

00:19:51.030 --> 00:19:52.450
What are we going to do, Naraku?

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:55.310
In the end, didn't Inuyasha become stronger?

00:19:57.150 --> 00:20:00.230
In this case, it's time to end his life...

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.200
... with the sword that threw Sesshomaru.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.630
Good! Great, Tessaiga!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:10.660
If it goes on like this, then I'll get out of Meidō!

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:18.040
Sword Sesshomaru?

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:24.680
In this sword is a fragment of the spirit of the mirror Cannes.

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:25.840
Naraku!

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:30.900
In other words, we can say that it is a part of me.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:33.230
Managing this is not difficult.

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.140
Poison!

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:42.320
Naraku!

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.870
Scum!

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.140
Up?

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:08.110
Sesshomaru...

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:11.920
- Sesshomaru-sama!
- Sesshomaru-sama!

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:16.490
Hmmm! I see that Inuyasha was weak, and decided to use a discarded sword?

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:30.880
So be it, Sesshomaru. You can finish it yourself.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:34.150
Naraku, I already have my answer.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:36.530
Get ready, Inuyasha.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:39.600
Heh! Enough Talk!

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:45.420
In my battle with Inuyasha, Naraku...

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.680
...you have no place.

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.210
Mirror shard...

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:17.750
What? Tenseig...?

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:34.300
He turned black... What is it?

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:37.300
Dark Path of the Dawn Moon's Wave...

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:40.570
They merged into one. So, so...

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:45.470
It looks as if Sesshomaru purposely broke his sword...

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:49.570
And because of this, the only way out of there disappeared.

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.190
Damn it! Poison Naraku...

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:03.810
This is the end.

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:08.050
Inuyasha's demonic energy has disappeared, and now...

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:12.410
... both of you cannot return to this world.

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:14.720
You broke the Poison Naraku...

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.470
In the end, you're only a half-breed.

00:23:24.810 --> 00:23:27.850
Hey! How do they get out of Meidō?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:31.660
What are you talking about? There is no way.

00:23:31.660 --> 00:23:33.420
- Not true!
- Can not be!

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:42.310
Sesshomaru... Can't you calm down?

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:44.130
Meidō closed.

00:23:44.290 --> 00:23:45.050
Eh ?!

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:50.900
Meidō will absorb us like that?
Or will we go back alive?

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:54.580
Inuyasha, it depends on you.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.150
On me?

00:23:57.920 --> 00:24:02.450
You're here with such a calm face.. If you know how to get out of here, then speak faster!

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:06.070
I said, it's up to you.

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:09.790
Use the new Tessaiga or what?

00:24:10.440 --> 00:24:12.090
Black Tessaiga?

00:24:13.620 --> 00:24:15.900
We do not have time for nonsense.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:18.370
Wha...?! My body...!

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:21.880
What should I do? Do I need to chop something up?

00:24:22.390 --> 00:24:25.430
Inuyasha, this sword is yours now.

00:24:26.010 --> 00:24:28.180
It remains only to be used by your hands.

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:32.560
Do not disappear, Sesshomaru!

00:24:32.860 --> 00:24:36.470
Do not you dare to die before my eyes, after you gave me the sword!

00:24:37.130 --> 00:24:39.420
He is unarmed. Therefore, I...

00:24:39.490 --> 00:24:41.910
We have to do this, Tessaiga!

00:24:43.760 --> 00:24:45.600
Damn it! Where?!

00:24:49.410 --> 00:24:50.320
Light...

00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.280
Inuyasha!

00:24:53.680 --> 00:24:54.740
Inuyasha!

00:24:54.740 --> 00:24:57.140
Sesshomaru-sama!
Inuyasha!

00:24:57.720 --> 00:24:58.520
Kagome!

00:24:58.610 --> 00:25:00.080
Inuyasha!

00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:02.000
Here!

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:26.080
Meidō...

00:25:26.370 --> 00:25:27.160
Oh?

00:25:29.090 --> 00:25:30.570
Ho... this is...

00:25:34.460 --> 00:25:37.450
- Inuyasha!
- Sesshomaru-sama!

00:25:40.240 --> 00:25:41.250
Terrible wounds.

00:25:42.700 --> 00:25:46.060
Sesshomaru, you did the same.

00:25:46.390 --> 00:25:49.730
Sesshomaru-sama, Jaken is so sad.

00:25:50.030 --> 00:25:53.810
Tenseiga was absorbed by Tessaiga.

00:25:53.810 --> 00:25:54.900
It makes no difference to me.
Tenseiga was absorbed by Tessaiga.

00:25:55.150 --> 00:25:56.120
Come on, Jaken.

00:25:56.240 --> 00:25:57.270
Oh? Yes.

00:25:58.170 --> 00:25:59.920
Wait, Sesshomaru.

00:26:00.420 --> 00:26:04.680
Maybe you don’t really need it, but still take it.

00:26:04.860 --> 00:26:07.390
He fell from the world of the dead.

00:26:08.920 --> 00:26:10.430
Are you fine, Inuyasha?

00:26:12.560 --> 00:26:15.060
This is... Tenseiga.

00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:17.870
But this sword has broken.

00:26:18.480 --> 00:26:22.000
That's how... The light in Meidō was from Tenseiga.

00:26:25.460 --> 00:26:30.640
Sword that Cannot Be Killed, Tenseiga, but...

00:26:31.790 --> 00:26:36.030
And? Do you intend me to save those people?

00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:37.580
Don't make me laugh.

00:26:37.740 --> 00:26:40.260
Wait for me, Sesshomaru-sama!

00:26:40.640 --> 00:26:41.790
Hey!

00:26:42.700 --> 00:26:43.530
This is...

00:26:43.530 --> 00:26:44.440
And what?

00:26:46.210 --> 00:26:48.510
I will give it to him when he is in a good mood.

00:26:48.790 --> 00:26:50.510
Sister, take care!

00:26:50.920 --> 00:26:51.870
Kohaku!

00:26:52.100 --> 00:26:53.870
Still, he went with them.

00:26:54.190 --> 00:26:55.580
Let him go.

00:26:56.200 --> 00:26:57.880
Do not worry.

00:26:58.560 --> 00:27:01.260
Kohaku has become a real man.

00:27:02.520 --> 00:27:03.260
Yes.

00:27:04.850 --> 00:27:06.320
Hey, Totosai.

00:27:06.690 --> 00:27:07.540
Eh?

00:27:07.670 --> 00:27:09.650
What will happen to Sesshomaru now?

00:27:09.770 --> 00:27:12.800
Everything my father left is now mine.

00:27:13.330 --> 00:27:18.570
The worry for the brother, better learn how to use the new Tessaiga faster.

00:27:18.670 --> 00:27:19.150
Eh?

00:27:19.510 --> 00:27:24.460
You should understand that you got out of Meidō not just because of your strength.

00:27:27.050 --> 00:27:30.730
If it were not for the light of Tenseiga and the voice of Kagome...

00:27:32.020 --> 00:27:32.740
Hmm...

00:27:33.200 --> 00:27:34.510
What, Inuyasha?

00:27:34.580 --> 00:27:36.000
N-Nothing.

00:27:36.280 --> 00:27:38.190
What are you doing? Speak come on.

00:27:38.890 --> 00:27:39.810
I didn't say anything.

00:27:39.810 --> 00:27:40.990
Tell me about it!

00:27:40.990 --> 00:27:42.990
Go out, get it!

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:44.740
Oh, yeah? Sit!

00:27:45.420 --> 00:27:46.280
Fool.

00:27:47.060 --> 00:27:50.160
Perhaps Sesshomaru didn't notice, but...

00:27:50.220 --> 00:27:57.220
... a little more and he can get not his father's gift, but his own weapon.
